{"3900170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "S.K.R.U.B. Squad", "steam_appid": 3900170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4861960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900170/extras/938361251a3aecdc4208751861d42898.avif?t=1783947040\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game by a solo developer, S.K.R.U.B. Squad is a low-intensity game about cozy cleaning rituals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly-created Slimeling recruit, you'll join the <strong>S.K.R.U.B. Squad</strong> to lend a hand to buff the multiverse back to perfection! Made up of a team of interplanetary slime folk who just really REALLY like cleaning, they travel the cosmos looking for the nastiest worlds to make <i>squeaky clean</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop between interesting worlds in space and time, meet talk to silly characters, and kick back and relax with this relaxing and low-intensity cleaning game. It's also playable solo or with up to four people in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900170/extras/d3901ccec6c4eefbd0e984bacc0ab2b4.avif?t=1783947040\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Clean solo or with up to four friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌏 A variety of levels to explore, from moody space ships to exotic cityscapes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👗 Diverse character customization options to make your Slimeling shine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨 Cool tools to clean with!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📝 Even more planned post-launch content!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "ab